## Installation

### macOS / Linux

**Homebrew (recommended on macOS):**

```bash
brew install {{.BrewFormula}}
```

**Shell script:**

```bash
curl -fsSL {{.LatestURL}}/install.sh | sh
```

This verifies the download's SHA-256 checksum against the published `SHA256SUMS`,
then installs to `/usr/local/bin` (may prompt for sudo). Set `{{.InstallDirEnvVar}}`
to a directory you own to install without sudo.

### Windows

**PowerShell:**

```powershell
irm {{.LatestURL}}/install.ps1 | iex
```

**Command Prompt (CMD):**

```cmd
curl -fsSL {{.LatestURL}}/install.cmd -o install.cmd && install.cmd
```

Both verify the download's SHA-256 checksum before installing to
`%LOCALAPPDATA%\Programs\{{.BinaryName}}` and adding it to your user PATH. Set
`{{.InstallDirEnvVar}}` to install somewhere else.
